                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Zouk's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Intersection positioning (ethnic + vegan + modern) creates unique brand space that Western competitors can't replicate + values-brands can't match on Indian cultural authenticity.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new handbag brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in specific positioning (luxury vegan, athletic-inspired, luxury-Indian). Zouk dominates ethnic-inspired vegan mid-market.</p>
                                        <h3>Is vegan positioning sustainable long-term?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — vegan consumer segment growing 25-40% YoY globally. Compounding tailwind for values-first brands.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest handbag D2C lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Intersection positioning + heritage authenticity + values consistency. Combined, defensible.</p>
